<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Hir,_Iran> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Hir** (Template:Lang-fa, also [Romanized](:Romanize) as **Hīr**) is a city in the [Hir District](:Hir_District) of [Ardabil County](:Ardabil_County), [Ardabil Province](:Ardabil_Province), [Iran](:Iran). At the 2006 census, its population was 2,588, in 663 families."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
