<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Takahama,_Aichi> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Takahama** (高浜市, *Takahama-shi*) is a [city](:Cities_of_Japan) located in central [Aichi Prefecture](:Aichi_Prefecture), [Japan](:Japan). As of 1 October 2019[[update]](//en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Takahama,_Aichi&action=edit), the city had an estimated [population](:Population) of 48,736 in 20,500 households, and a [population density](:Population_density) of 3,717 persons per km2. The total area of the city is 13.11 square kilometres (5.06 sq mi)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
