<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Montreal_West,_Quebec> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Montreal West (French: Montréal-Ouest) is an on-island suburb in southwestern Quebec, Canada, on the Island of Montreal. Montreal West is a small, close-knit community made up primarily of single-family dwellings. The town is largely composed of families, with 77% of the population speaking English as their primary language at home, the highest percentage on the island."@en .
