<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Mostyska> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Mostyska** (Template:Lang-uk, Template:Lang-pl, both in the *plural*), is a small city in [Yavoriv Raion](:Yavoriv_Raion), [Lviv Oblast](:Lviv_Oblast) ([region](:Oblast%29) of [Ukraine](:Ukraine). It hosts the administration of Mostyska urban hromada, one of the [hromadas](:Hromada) of Ukraine. Population: 9,188 (2021 est.). The city is located in western portion of [Sian Lowland](:Sian_Lowland) near the border with Poland (14 km (8.7 mi))."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
