<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Ardabil_province> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Ardabil Province (Persian: استان اردبیل; Azerbaijani: اردبیل اوستانی) is one of the thirty-one provinces of Iran. It is in the northwest of the country, in Region 3, bordering the Republic of Azerbaijan, the provinces of East Azerbaijan, Zanjan, and Gilan. Its administrative centre is the city of Ardabil. The province was established in 1993 from the eastern part of East Azerbaijan."@en .
