<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Hamura,_Tokyo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Hamura (羽村市, Hamura-shi) is a city located in the western portion of Tokyo Metropolis, Japan. As of 1 April 2021, the city had an estimated population of 54,622, and a population density of 5500 persons per km². The total area of the city was 9.90 square kilometres (3.82 sq mi)."@en .
