<http://dbpedia.org/resource/East_Orange,_New_Jersey> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "East Orange is a city in Essex County, New Jersey. As of the 2020 U.S. census, the city's population was 69,612. The city was the state's 20th most-populous municipality in 2010, after having been the state's 14th most-populous municipality in 2000. The Census Bureau's Population Estimates Program calculated that the city's population was 64,367 in 2019, ranking the city the 590th-most-populous in the country."@en .
