<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Bragado> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Bragado** is a city in the center-northwest [province](:Provinces_of_Argentina) of [Buenos Aires](:Buenos_Aires_Province), Argentina, and the head town of [Bragado Partido](:Bragado_Partido). The city is 210 km west-southwest from [Buenos Aires City](:Buenos_Aires), not far from the [Salado River](:Salado_River_%28Buenos_Aires%29). Bragado is served by the [Sarmiento Railway](:Sarmiento_Railway) with services running from the train station there to [Once railway station](:Once_railway_station) in [Buenos Aires](:Buenos_Aires)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
