<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Safayyeh_District> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Safayyeh District (Persian: بخش صفائیه) is a district (bakhsh) in Khoy County, West Azerbaijan Province, Iran. At the 2006 census, its population was 20,172, in 3,798 families. The District has one city: Zurabad. The District has two rural districts (dehestan): Aland Rural District and Sokmanabad Rural District."@en .
