<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Anna,_Illinois> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Anna** is the largest community and retail trade center in [Union County](:Union_County%2C_Illinois), [Illinois](:Illinois), United States. Located in [Southern Illinois](:Southern_Illinois), its population was 4,442 at the [2010 United States Census](:2010_United_States_Census), a decline from 5,135 in 2000. It is known for being tied to its close neighbor [Jonesboro](:Jonesboro%2C_Illinois), together known as Anna-Jonesboro. Anna is known for the [Choate Mental Health and Development Center](:Choate_Mental_Health_and_Development_Center), a state facility that opened in 1869."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
