<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Qotbabad> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Qotbabad** (Template:Lang-fa, also [Romanized](:Romanize) as **Qoţbābād**; also known as **Kowtbābād** and **Qutbābād**) is a city and capital of [Kordian District](:Kordian_District), in [Jahrom County](:Jahrom_County), [Fars Province](:Fars_Province), [Iran](:Iran). At the 2006 census, its population was 6,450, in 1,581 families. At the 2016 census, its population was 7,476, in 2,250 families."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
