<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Kakhovka> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Kakhovka (Ukrainian: Кахо́вка, pronounced [kɐˈxɔu̯kɐ]; formerly İslâm Kermen, اسلام كرمان) is a port city on the Dnieper River in Kakhovka Raion, Kherson Oblast, of southern Ukraine. It hosts the administration of the , one of the hromadas of Ukraine. It had a population of 35,400 (2021 est.) It is home to the (Electro-Welding Equipment Plant) and the festival."@en .
