<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Coahuila> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Coahuila (Spanish pronunciation: [koaˈwila]), formally Coahuila de Zaragoza (American Spanish: [koaˈwila ðe saɾaˈɣosa]), officially the Free and Sovereign State of Coahuila de Zaragoza (Spanish: Estado Libre y Soberano de Coahuila de Zaragoza), is one of the 32 states of Mexico. The largest city and State Capital is the city of Saltillo; the second largest is Torreón (largest metropolitan area in Coahuila and 9th largest in Mexico); the third largest is Monclova (a former state capital); the fourth largest is Ciudad Acuña; and the fifth largest is Piedras Negras."@en .
