<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Province_of_Córdoba_(Spain)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Córdoba (Spanish pronunciation: [ˈkoɾðoβa]), also called Cordova in English, is one of the 50 provinces of Spain, in the north-central part of the autonomous community of Andalusia. It is bordered by the Andalusian provinces of Málaga, Seville, Jaén, and Granada, the Extremaduran province of Badajoz and the province of Ciudad Real, which is part of the autonomous community of Castile-La Mancha. Its area is 13,769 km2."@en .
