<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Vicco,_Kentucky> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Vicco** is a Kentucky defunct city in [Perry](:Perry_County%2C_Kentucky) and [Knott](:Knott_County%2C_Kentucky) counties, [Kentucky](:Kentucky), United States as defined by Kentucky Act Acts Ch. 25. The population was 334 at the [2010 census](:2010_United_States_Census).On January 16, 2013, Vicco became the smallest city in the United States to pass an ordinance outlawing discrimination based on [sexual orientation](:Sexual_orientation)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
