<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Golestan_province> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Golestān Province (Persian: استان گلستان, Ostān-e Golestān) is one of the 31 provinces of Iran, located in the north-east of the country and south-east of the Caspian Sea. Its capital is Gorgan. The province was put as part of Region 1 upon the division of the provinces into 5 regions solely for coordination and development purposes on 22 June 2014. Majority of its population are Sunni Muslims."@en .
