<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Central_District_(Chaypareh_County)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Central District of Chaypareh County (Persian: بخش مرکزی شهرستان چايپاره) is a district (bakhsh) in Chaypareh County, West Azerbaijan Province, Iran. At the 2006 census, its population was 33,369, in 8,133 families. The District has one city: Qarah Zia od Din. The District has two rural districts (dehestan): Bastam Rural District and Churs Rural District."@en .
