<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Oskaloosa,_Iowa> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Oskaloosa** is a [city](:List_of_cities_in_Iowa) in, and the [county seat](:County_seat) of, [Mahaska County](:Mahaska_County%2C_Iowa), [Iowa](:Iowa), United States. In the late nineteenth and early twentieth century, Oskaloosa was a national center of [bituminous coal](:Bituminous_coal) mining. The population was 11,558 in the [2020 U.S. Census](:2020_United_States_Census), an increase from 10,938 in [2000](:2000_United_States_Census)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
