<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Huechuraba> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "  **Huechuraba** (Template:IPA-es is a [city](:List_of_cities_in_Chile) and [commune](:Communes_of_Chile) of [Chile](:Chile) located in [Santiago Province](:Santiago_Province%2C_Chile), [Santiago Metropolitan Region](:Santiago_Metropolitan_Region).Huechuraba has a mild [mediterranean](:Mediterranean) climate: relatively hot dry summers (November to March) with temperatures reaching up to 35 °C (95 °F) on the hottest days; winters (June to August) are more humid, with typical maximum daily temperatures of 12 °C (54 °F), and minimums of a few degrees above freezing."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
