<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Lanxi,_Zhejiang> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Lanxi**, alternately known as **Lanchi** and **Lanki**, is a [county-level city](:County-level_city) under the administration of the [prefecture-level city](:Prefecture-level_city) of [Jinhua](:Jinhua) in west-central [Zhejiang Province](:Zhejiang_Province), east-central China.The city executive, legislature and [judiciary](:Basic_People%27s_Court) are at Lanjiang Subdistrict (兰江街道), together with the [CPC](:Communist_Party_of_China) and [PSB](:Public_Security_Bureau) branches. The town lies on the [Lan River](:Lan_River) (Lanjiang), a tributary of the [Fuchun River](:Fuchun_River), both north-flowing; the Fuchun River empties into [Hangzhou Bay](:Hangzhou_Bay)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
