<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Bihta> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Bihta** is a town and [Block](:Community_development_block) in [Patna district](:Patna_district), [Bihar state](:Bihar), [India](:India). Bihta is part of [Maner Assembly constituency](:Maner_Assembly_constituency) and [Pataliputra Lok Sabha constituency](:Pataliputra_Lok_Sabha_constituency). It is located around 30 km (19 mi) west of [Patna](:Patna). Bihta is also an upcoming [satellite town](:Satellite_town) of [Patna](:Patna). It lies 7 km (4.3 mi) from [Bihta railway station](:Bihta_railway_station)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
