<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Hosur> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Hosur** is an industrial city located in the Indian [state](:States_and_territories_of_India) of [Tamil Nadu](:Tamil_Nadu). Hosur is one of the municipal corporations in Tamil Nadu. It is located on the bank of the river [River Ponnaiyar](:River_Ponnaiyar), 40 kilometres (25 mi) southeast of [Bengaluru](:Bengaluru) and 306 kilometres (190 mi) west of [Chennai](:Chennai), the state capital. Hosur is home to major manufacturing industries including [Stellantis](:Stellantis), [Ashok Leyland](:Ashok_Leyland), [Titan](:Titan_Industries), [TVS Motors](:TVS_Motors), [Caterpillar](:Caterpillar_Inc%2E), [Ather Energy](:Ather_Energy), [Sundaram Fasteners](:TVS_Group), [Schaeffler](:Schaeffler_Group), and many others."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
