<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Mostyska> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Mostyska (Ukrainian: Мости́ська, Polish: Mościska, both in the plural), is a small city in Yavoriv Raion, Lviv Oblast (region) of Ukraine. It hosts the administration of , one of the hromadas of Ukraine. Population: 9,188 (2021 est.). The city is located in western portion of Sian Lowland near the border with Poland (14 km (8.7 mi))."@en .
